          "note": "Base Units: a main subheading of 1.2 International System of Units, its own page (owner 2026-11-04); PDF 5-5."
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Physical quantities ke saat (7) base units hain: length, mass, time, temperature, electric current, luminous intensity (roshni kitni tez hai) aur amount of substance (maadde ki amount, yani particles ki tadaad ke hisaab se). In ke saath milli, micro, kilo waghaira jaise prefixes laga kar chhoti ya bari quantities likhi ja sakti hain."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "In base units ke naam aur symbols Table 1.1 mein diye gaye hain."
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "caption": "Table 1.1",
            "header": [
              "Physical Quantity",
              "SI Unit",
              "Symbol"
            ],
            "rows": [
